      {
        "name": "Human Interviews",
        "description": "The interviewees are of different age, place, race, background, religion, belief, and experience \u2013 all answering the same existential questions about self, time, love, death, perception, and other things that bring wonder to me. Mostly unanswerable things.\r\n\r\nWhen aired on the radio, the interviews include a favorite song or two of the participants or mine. The purpose of the project is not to find answers, but to ask the questions and to share other people\u2019s perspectives since I believe listening to different ideas and imagining new ways of being is important for humanity.",
